# Bass — linha de baixo com filtro low-pass ressonante

sample_rate 44100
duration 4.0

osc saw freq=110 amp=0.5
filter lowpass 900 1.4
env adsr 0.005 0.15 0.5 0.2

note C2 0.25
note C2 0.25
note Eb2 0.25
note F2 0.25
note C2 0.25
note C2 0.25
note Eb2 0.25
note F2 0.25
note G2 0.5
note F2 0.5
note Eb2 0.5
note C2 0.5

output bass.wav
